# Unit-test binaries and their fetched headers (tests/unit/Makefile downloads
# nlohmann/json.hpp the same way the Dockerfile does).
# test_text_utils was previously committed as an x86-64 Linux ELF, which made
# `make -C tests/unit` fail on every other platform: make saw the binary as
# up to date and tried to execute it.
